{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_F3DE1CC5","title":"Found 1-5 Tumblers","entry":"Dlg_F3DE1CC5::entry","exit":"Dlg_F3DE1CC5::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2E114C66","articyId":"72057619807800134","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Hey there! I see a k20 handle sticking out there. You found some?","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey there! I see a k20 handle sticking out there. You found some?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51503","byteOffset":33900600,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_87DA759E","articyId":"72057619807800156","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Good! Now, get back out there! You're off to a good start but I know you got some more left in yah. Don't let me hold you back!","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good! Now, get back out there! You're off to a good start but I know you got some more left in yah. Don't let me hold you back!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4725.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52611","byteOffset":34317552,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_006E46DE","articyId":"72057619807800164","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"That's great! You didn't drink out of it did you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's great! You didn't drink out of it did you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22765","byteOffset":16496808,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_99B39A53","articyId":"72057619807800184","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Oh good. Can't do that. Just, yeah, if you find another one, which I know you will, just don't drink out of it ok?","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh good. Can't do that. Just, yeah, if you find another one, which I know you will, just don't drink out of it ok?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16997","byteOffset":14321256,"byteLength":508}},{"id":"DFr_09FAF124","articyId":"72057619807800240","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Because... I don't want to see anything happen to you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because... I don't want to see anything happen to you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48085","byteOffset":32528816,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_5CF38949","articyId":"72057619807800255","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Because then they're not pristine! I'm afraid if the rare ones, the few that only exist solo or in pairs, are used... then the ghost won't come. It'll think we soiled its lanterns.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because then they're not pristine! I'm afraid if the rare ones, the few that only exist solo or in pairs, are used... then the ghost won't come. It'll think we soiled its lanterns.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2300.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43018","byteOffset":30604576,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_D5E603FA","articyId":"72057619807800284","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"I mean it could eat you... as payback. Though I guess you don't really eat a k20 so much as drink from it. Maybe it'd drink from your soul? That'd be fucked.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I mean it could eat you... as payback. Though I guess you don't really eat a k20 so much as drink from it. Maybe it'd drink from your soul? That'd be fucked.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39141","byteOffset":29139544,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_DB3303E6","articyId":"72057619807800298","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Then again, maybe nothing would happen. I mean, if you were locked away in 123 different containers and couldn't come out until they were reunited, how pissed would you be?","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Then again, maybe nothing would happen. I mean, if you were locked away in 123 different containers and couldn't come out until they were reunited, how pissed would you be?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29857","byteOffset":19176456,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_8B3C40F8","articyId":"72057619807800319","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Definitely. So maybe just don't take the chance and drink out of one? At least one of the rare ones. You can grab a cheaper, common style and drink until you drown if you want! Though don't do that. At least until you've helped me find the others!","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Definitely. So maybe just don't take the chance and drink out of one? At least one of the rare ones. You can grab a cheaper, common style and drink until you drown if you want! Though don't do that. At least until you've helped me find the others!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35103","byteOffset":25640744,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_5E07076D","articyId":"72057619807800335","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Well, it means a lot that you're helping me find the last few I need. I've been doing this for so long I kinda forgot what it was like to have someone close to you. A friend or, I don't know, maybe something more.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, it means a lot that you're helping me find the last few I need. I've been doing this for so long I kinda forgot what it was like to have someone close to you. A friend or, I don't know, maybe something more.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2900.0,"y":-475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49692","byteOffset":33141152,"byteLength":572}},{"id":"DFr_A1A938EC","articyId":"72057619807800356","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Of course! No, that's why I said friend. Sorry, I didn't mean to imply otherwise!","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Of course! No, that's why I said friend. Sorry, I didn't mean to imply otherwise!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":-400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23508","byteOffset":16772272,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_87976BBD","articyId":"72057619807800373","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"It does, doesn't it. I'm glad you're here. I can't wait to see the ghost with you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It does, doesn't it. I'm glad you're here. I can't wait to see the ghost with you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3500.0,"y":-650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49418","byteOffset":33037304,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_97946B7F","articyId":"72057619807800139","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I got a few.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I got a few.","TextSheVersion":"I got a few.","TextTheyVersion":"I got a few."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":500.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49520","byteOffset":33076408,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_7EEC7E17","articyId":"72057619807800177","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No.","TextSheVersion":"No.","TextTheyVersion":"No."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1100.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48382","byteOffset":32639656,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_A12BF59F","articyId":"72057619807800204","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why not?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronou